<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-McDonald Brushware in Artel contract.</title>
<headline>RTRS-McDonald Brushware in Artel contract.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange said on Monday that the securities of McDonald Brushware Ltd would be suspended from official quotation immediately as the company had entered into a contract to sell its main operating business to Artel Industries Ltd of New Zealand.</p>
<p>Shareholder approval would be sought at the annual general meeting on October 17.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
